  "releaseNotes": "RELEASE NOTES:\n=================\nA UI library for fast, visually stunning desktop apps in C#/VB, .NET WinForms, and Visual Studio IDE.\n\n* IMPORTANT PLEASE READ:\nBack up your project before updating Siticone UI Library.\n---------------------\n\nImprovements:\nSiticone DataTable: You can now customize the Dropdown Trigger Button text and sizing.\n\n\nNew Controls:\n\n# Siticone CreditCardUI: Displays credit card info with advanced state management, events, etc.\n# Siticone Pinnable Panel: Events driven, advanced and fluid panels that can pin vertically, grid, horizontally, etc.\n# Siticone Pinnable Panel Host: Hosts pinnable panels with events for Pinned, Unpinned, Reordered, etc.\n# Siticone Dashboard Card: A customizable card control for dashboard UI designs, dashboard containers, etc.\n# Siticone Segmented Button: A hub for multiple buttons, perfect for switcher controls, etc.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
